WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Running a state is far more complicated than it looks.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.500
Public administration is complex.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:09.500
It takes knowledge, preparation, experience.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:14.000
And it only works when every piece fits perfectly together.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:17.500
Health, jobs, education, safety.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:23.500
When everything clicks into place, people's lives truly change.

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:26.000
Clécio is the best choice because he transformed Macapá.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:28.500
And he'll transform Amapá.

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:30.500
For everyone.
